        description: Some("Two fields, baked one at a time: `filaments`, the brightness of the radial threads, which peaks near 1.05; and `reach`, in [0, 1], how far each streamer goes. The client samples both on the direction out from the star, turned by a rotation drawn from the star\'s seed, so one bake serves every star. Baked on a sphere, so only Color, Noise, Coordinate, Mix, MinMax and Wave may appear."),
